~ Core Features:
User Registration & Authentication

1) Filter - as a User/Professional you can chose a filter based on preferences/beliefs/availability/location

2) Ratings - as an Admin you can update the rating system of stars (1-5).

3) Swipe (click) - as a User you can choose which professional of what category you like.
                   as a Professional you can accept the User and the Terms of working with them.

4) Appointment - as a User you can set an appointment time to meet up within the Professional's availability.

5) Logs - as a Professional you can give a summary of the recent appointment.

6) Message - as a User/Professional you can message in the app

7) SOS - can help alleviate unsafe environments without the need for calling 911.
                   With permission can call on your behalf with your information.


Pregnant users and birth professionals (doctors, midwives, doulas) can sign up and log in.

--------------------------------------------------

Profile Creation:
Pregnant Users (PU) can specify their birth preferences (Example: hospital birth, home birth, pain management options,
                                                    Timeframe, C-section preferences...).

Professionals (PRO) can list their availability and their specialties: location, experience, and philosophy on birth.

--------------------------------------------------

Matching System:
PU can swipe (maybe just click a check mark) through PRO who align with their preferences.

PU must "swipe" first on the desired Professional, the PRO must accept based on the timeframe
                                                        and the desired need of the Pregnant User.

Once "matched" the PRO is prompted to start the conversation with prompt information at the beginning and
then have extra information they would like to share. Then the app allows PU to get connected and respond.

Messaging System (Authentication Required)

Booking Appointments (Authentication Required)

PU can schedule consultations with PRO.

